# Cursor Rules for BriefCortex

## Architecture
- Frontend: Next.js App Router in /frontend (routes in app/, logic in src/)
- Backend: FastAPI in /backend/app
- Never mix frontend and backend logic
- Before writing code, read KARPATHY.md

## Frontend Rules
- Components live in src/components/briefing/ or src/components/ui/
- All API calls go in src/api/ — never fetch/axios directly in components
- Custom hooks in src/hooks/, pure utils in src/lib/
- TypeScript strict mode — no any without a comment
- Tailwind + clay CSS classes from src/styles/globals.css
- / redirects to /briefing (authless)

## Backend Rules
- Route handlers delegate to services — keep routes thin
- Business logic in app/services/
- HTTP I/O schemas in app/models/
- Settings via pydantic-settings in app/core/config.py
- Conflict detection output must never enter the LLM prompt

## API Contract
- POST /api/briefings → 202 { request_id }
- GET /api/briefings/{request_id} → status + optional report

## Testing
- Backend: pytest from backend/, mirrors app/ services
- Frontend: keep presentational components free of side effects

## Git
- Branch naming: feature/, fix/, chore/, docs/
